# Build output only.
#
# This is an E2E fixture, not a standalone project: the source is committed and
# the binaries are built on demand by devtools-panel.spec.ts. The scaffolded
# template .gitignore was replaced because it also excluded *.pubxml, which
# would have dropped the publish profiles the csproj references.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# The repo-root .gitignore excludes *.pubxml globally. The csproj references these
# publish profiles by name, so re-include them here to keep the fixture complete
# on a fresh clone.
!Properties/PublishProfiles/*.pubxml
